  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width: 315px; border-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 90%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Great War (Tel-ma)\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"infobox\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin: 0; cellpadding: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Date\n</th>\n<td>2075 - 2087\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Location\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tel-ma\" title=\"Tel-ma\">Tel-ma</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Causes\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Result\n</th>\n<td>Inconclusive\n<ul><li>Mutual destruction</li>\n<li>Near-extinction of life on Tel-ma.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Belligerents\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\">Northern Bloc</span></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\">Southern Bloc</span></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Commanders\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\">Northern Leaders</span></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\">Southern Leaders</span></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Strength\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">75.7 million\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">69.1 million\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Casualties and losses\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">2 billion\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">3 billion\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>The <b>Second Great War of Tel-Ma</b> was a global war on <a href=\"/wiki/Tel-ma\" title=\"Tel-ma\">Tel-ma</a> that lasted from 2075 to 2087, although related conflicts began earlier and some factions had continued to fight all the way up to First Contact. It involved the vast majority of the Tel-ma's countries—including all of the great powers—eventually forming two opposing military alliances. It was the most widespread war in Tel-ma's history, and brought much of the planet to a state of total war, erasing the distinction between civilian and military resources. The war was marked by saturation bombing, and the use of nuclear and chemical warfare, the conflict ultimately led to the near extinction of the <a href=\"/wiki/Tel-bn\" title=\"Tel-bn\">Tel-bn</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Background\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Background</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Course_of_the_war\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Course of the war</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#War_breaks_out\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">War breaks out</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Nuclear_war\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nuclear war</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Aftermath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Aftermath</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#First_Contact\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">First Contact</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Great_War_%28Tel-ma%29%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Course_of_the_war\">Course of the war</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Great_War_%28Tel-ma%29%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;usel